 			<p>“I’ll wait; and in the meantime, you could be learning to like me. Would it be a very hard lesson, dear?”</p>
 			<p>“Not if I chose to learn it, but⁠—”</p>
 			<p>“Please choose to learn, Meg. I love to teach, and this is easier than German,” broke in John, getting possession of the other hand, so that she had no way of hiding her face, as he bent to look into it.</p>
